<http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#ElectricalConnector> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#ElectricalInterface> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#ElectropneumaticActuatorComponent> a owl:Class ;
