<http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#Housing> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#DeviceComponent> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/yanha/ontologies/2025/7/untitled-ontology-26#Plug> a owl:Class ;
